    reveal: [["f", "His uncle saw him smacking his lips and staring for a minute without answering."], ["r", "Each spell is the same: stomach, smell, then the feeling he has seen it before."], ["t", "He is afraid to drive his scooter on the hill roads now."]],
    risk: "Asked clearly: no thoughts of self-harm. Risk from spells while driving or near the road; needs neurology review and advice not to drive until assessed.",
