    reveal: [["r", "When she smells smoke, she is back in the burning village."], ["v", "She sometimes forgets to feed the youngest when the numbness comes."], ["t", "She does not know if her husband is alive and cannot grieve or hope."]],
    risk: "Asked clearly (through the interpreter): has thoughts of dying when she thinks of her husband; no plan; children keep her going. Child welfare concern; needs safety plan, food and shelter support, and trauma-informed care.",
