    ex: ["md-psychiatry", "ugc-net"], obj: "Plan care for treatment-resistant OCD with depression and risk",
    who: ["Harsh Vora", 29, "male", "unemployed, previously a bank clerk", "Rajkot", "parents, married sister", "Gujarati-Hindi, tired, irritable"],
    pres: "Ten years of contamination and checking OCD; housebound for two years; rituals eight hours a day; two SSRIs at full dose for 12 weeks each, partial benefit; one ERP attempt dropped after a week; now low mood, hopelessness, and the family's lives arranged around his rituals.",
    cc: "Nothing works. I've tried tablets, I've tried therapy. I'm the problem.",
