    belief: "If I stop, my family will get ill and it will be my fault; and I am too weak to stop.",
    reveal: [["f", "His mother washes all his clothes three times and his father stays out of the house to avoid conflict."], ["r", "He dropped ERP because the first exposure felt unbearable and he was not told what to expect."], ["t", "He has thought that ending his life would free his family."]],
