    mse: "Unshaven, raw hands | Restless, avoids touching chair | Irritable | 'Hopeless' | Low, irritable | Coherent | Contamination and checking obsessions with fair insight, hopelessness, suicidal ideation | No abnormal perceptions | Intact | Good insight into OCD, poor hope",
    dx: "Treatment-resistant obsessive-compulsive disorder with a depressive episode",
    ddx: [["Inadequate treatment", "Two SSRI trials were adequate in dose and duration, though ERP was not properly delivered and should be tried again"], ["Psychotic disorder", "He sees the fears as excessive and has no delusions or hallucinations"], ["Autism spectrum", "There are no lifelong social communication difficulties; rituals began at 19"]],
    rubric: ["Validated his exhaustion and built rapport", "Explored treatment history for adequacy, including how ERP was delivered", "Explored family accommodation with the family", "Asked about suicide clearly and made a safety plan", "Discussed next steps such as clomipramine, antipsychotic augmentation and graded ERP with home support"],
