    id: "cr-193", title: "Raghu, 33: new rituals since the new tablet", d: "cooperative", lv: 5, topic: "ocd", mod: "antipsychotics",
    ex: ["md-psychiatry", "ugc-net"], obj: "Recognise obsessions emerging on clozapine and plan treatment",
    who: ["Raghu Shetty", 33, "male", "works in his family's hardware shop", "Udupi", "parents, younger sister", "Tulu-Kannada-English, slow, earnest"],
